sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    Note over P,UI: Requires UC-02: a wayside is selected.
    P->>UI: click Load .plc file
    UI-->>P: file dialog
    P->>UI: choose program.plc
    UI->>S: loadProgramFromUrl(url)
    S->>S: read the file (UTF-8)
    alt the file cannot be read
        S-->>UI: terminal: could not read program.plc
    else read
        S->>S: buffer := source, clear the last RUN
        S-->>UI: buffer changed
        UI-->>P: program in the editor, NOT COMMITTED
        Note right of S: Nothing reaches the wayside: the program still has to be RUN and committed.
    end
